    the one-time process bootstrap subtracted. B is taken PER ARM: SeferAlloc
    rows use large_alloc_free_cycle (B=3,308); mimalloc_* rows use
    mimalloc_bootstrap_proxy (B=13,050) — the two allocators' bootstrap
    constants are never mixed (R22-15/task #366). Comparable across benches
    within the SAME arm; the honest unit for per-op thresholds (review finding
    F2). "-" = bootstrap proxy / no op-count / that arm's bootstrap bench absent.

